        "details": "This is the key engine-bay hotspot for the M111 family because it covers the area where ageing engine wiring, vacuum leaks, ignition-side issues, and upper-engine oil leaks often begin to overlap. Most frustrating E 220 drivability faults start here as several small age-related problems rather than one major failure."
