      oilAndCooling: { oilSquirters: "Yes, dedicated high-pressure jets to cool piston crowns.", oilPumpType: "Chain-driven gear pump.", thermostatOpening: "80°C.", oilCooler: "Large external air-to-oil cooler located in the passenger side front bumper well." },
