      "Valve-to-Piston Contact (Guides): Ignoring the ticking sound of a loose timing chain guarantees that the plastic guides will shatter and the chain will jump, requiring a complete engine rebuild.",
      "Electronic Throttle Actuator (ETA) Failure: The wiring inside the electronic throttle body also degrades. Rebuilding the ETA is mandatory to cure limp mode and severe idle surging.",
      "Irreplaceable Body/Trim Parts Scarcity: While standard M119 engine parts are available, any chassis or cooling parts specific to the Porsche-built E 500 widebody are incredibly difficult to source."
