      "VNT Turbo Vane Sticking: Carbon buildup causes the variable geometry vanes inside the turbo to stick, resulting in severe Limp Mode and underboost codes.",
      "Thermostat Failure: OM611 engines frequently run cold due to failed thermostats, severely impacting fuel economy and preventing proper combustion temperatures."
