      "EGR and Intake Manifold Clogging: The aggressive emissions tuning causes heavy soot buildup in the EGR valve and intake manifolds, eventually jamming the swirl flaps.",
      "Electronic Turbo Actuator Failure: The black box bolted to the side of the turbocharger fails from heat exposure, causing total loss of boost."
