      "Intake Manifold Swirl Flap Failure: The EGR system coats the intake manifold with thick soot. This jams the plastic swirl flaps, causing the linkage to break.",
      "Thermostat Failure: OM648 engines frequently run cold due to failed thermostats, severely impacting fuel economy and preventing proper combustion temperatures.",
